#16202
Chaos avatar~
the Avatar of Chaos~
The Avatar of Chaos stands here, burning fiercely.~
In it's right hand is a flute, symbolic of the creative aspect of Chaos.
Chaos generates new things, randomly, and sets them free in the world.
In society, this means new ideas, inventions, celebration and birth.
All the things that make life worth living.

In it's right hand is a mace, symbolic of the distructive aspect of Chaos.
Chaos brings entropy, kills and maims, and makes way for all new things.
In society, this means war, revolution.  Breaking up the groups and
organizations, using mob violence, tapping the darker nature of man.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN
0 S
99 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 2d2000+10000 25d7+19
0 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>greet_prog 100~
if whichgod($n) == 2
  mpechoat $n The Avatar of Chaos says 'Greetings warrior of Chaos'
  mpechoat $n The Avatar of Chaos says 'Make yourself at home...'
  mpechoat $n The Avatar of Chaos says 'dont drool on the carpet.'
  mpechoat $n The Avatar of Chaos says 'If you need the special' 
  mpechoat $n The Avatar of Chaos says 'equipment just ask.'
endif
~
>speech_prog equipment token hole~
if whichgod($n) != 2
  say ... idiot
  slay $n
else
  mpecho The Avatar of Chaos says 'remember, you can only' 
  mpecho The Avatar of Chaos says 'get the equipment once every'
  mpecho The Avatar of Chaos says 'ten levels.'
  if quest(1,1,$n) == 0
    if level($n) >= 10
      if level($n) < 20
        mpoload 16201
        if actorhasobjnum(16201)
          mpjunk token162_C
          mpechoat $n The Avatar of Chaos says 'You already have a token.'
        endif
        give token162_C $n
        mpjunk token162_C
        mpoload 16202
        if actorhasobjnum(16202)
          mpjunk hole162_C
          mpechoat $n The Avatar of Chaos says 'You already have a hole.'
        endif
        give hole162_C $n
        mpjunk hole162_C
        mpmset $n quest 1 1 1
      endif
    endif
  endif
  if quest(2,1,$n) == 0
    if level($n) >= 20
      if level($n) < 30
        mpoload 16201
        if actorhasobjnum(16201)
          mpjunk token162_C
          mpechoat $n The Avatar of Chaos says 'You already have a token.'
        endif
        give token162_C $n
        mpjunk token162_C
        mpoload 16202
        if actorhasobjnum(16202)
          mpjunk hole162_C
          mpechoat $n The Avatar of Chaos says 'You already have a hole.'
        endif
        give hole162_C $n
        mpjunk hole162_C
        mpmset $n quest 2 1 1
      endif
    endif
  endif
  if quest(3,1,$n) == 0
    if level($n) >= 30
      if level($n) < 40
