#16205
Chaos knight high~
The High Knight of Chaos~
The High Knight of Chaos stands here, guarding the Monastery.~
Glowing red eyes are all you can see through layers and
layers of solid armor. You wonder how it can even stand.
A dark red light seems to shine on it's body, as it moves.
Which it doesnt do much, as it glances about slowly.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY
0 S
149 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 2d2000+30000 35d7+49
0 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>rand_prog 100~
if quest(0,2,$i) > 0
  mpgoto 16200
  mpmadd $i quest 0 2 -1 
endif
~
>range_prog 100~
mpmset $i quest 0 2 2
~
>greet_prog 100~
if whichgod($n) == 1
  mpkill $n
else
  if whichgod($n) == 2
    mpechoat $n The High Knight of Chaos nods.
  else
    mpechoat $n The High Knight of Choas kicks you out.
    mptransfer $n 17652
    mpat 17652 mpforce $n look
  endif
endif
~
>fight_prog 100~
mpmset $i quest 0 2 2
mpquiet on
cast 'tremor'
~
