#OBJECTS
#16201
token162_C Chaos~
a token of Chaos~
There is a small card of some dark metal lying here.~
There is an inscription on the back of the token...

  ____________________________________________________________________
 |                                                                    |
 | This token can be used to restore any follower of Chaos... once    |
 | every 4 game hours. The command 'call-Chaos' activates it. It must |
 |  be held to work.                                                  |
 |____________________________________________________________________|

To check if you can call upon the power of Chaos use the command: checktoken.~
ITEM_TYPE_CONTAINER
ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL|ITEM_FLAG_AUTO_ENGRAVE
ITEM_WEAR_TAKE|ITEM_WEAR_HOLD
1 CONT_CLOSEABLE -1 0
0 0 10
P 0
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 call-Chaos
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_WHICH_GOD = 2 1 6
P 1
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_WEAR_LOC ! WEAR_NONE 2 8
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_OBJECT_QUEST_IF 0 12  = 0 3 7
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_PK_STATUS = 2 13 5
P 5
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
recho The power of Chaos fills the room. & restore $~
P 5
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_QUEST_SET 0 12 800
P 6
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You arent a follower of Chaos.~
P 7
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You cant call on the power of Chaos again yet.~
P 8
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You must hold the token to call on Chaos.~
P 10
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 checktoken
OPROG_OBJECT_QUEST_IF 0 12  = 0 11 12
P 11
TRIG_VOID 
OPROG_ECHO
You can call on the power of Chaos.~
P 12
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You cant call on the power of Chaos again yet.~
P 13
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You can only use this power during combat with Order Scum or times of dire need!~
P 20
TRIG_TICK 100
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_WHICH_GOD = 0 30 21
P 21
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_WHICH_GOD = 1 31 22
P 22
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_WHICH_GOD = 4 32 23
P 23
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_OBJECT_QUEST_IF 0 12  > 0 24 0
P 24
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_QUEST_ADD 0 12 -1
P 30
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
Learn the wrath of Chaos, you nerveless cretin!~
P 30
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_APPLY OAPPLY_HIT -500
P 30
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_APPLY OAPPLY_MANA -500
P 30
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_APPLY OAPPLY_MOVE -500
P 30
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_JUNK
P 31
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
May the fiery wrath of Chaos see your soul through to oblivion!~
P 31
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_APPLY OAPPLY_HIT -500
P 31
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_APPLY OAPPLY_MANA -500
P 31
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_APPLY OAPPLY_MOVE -500
P 31
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_JUNK
P 32
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You need a token ?~
P 32
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_JUNK
#16202
hole162_C portable Chaos~
a portable hole of Chaos~
There is a circular hoop of dark metal lying here.~
A dark metal circle serves as a frame for what appears to be
a hole into another place in the realms.  You can even feel hot
air coming out of it.  

As you look closely you see there is writing around the outside 
of the circle...

  ___________________________________________________________________________
 |                                                                           |
 | Followers of Chaos can use this portable hole to warp a gate to the       |
 | monastery of Chaos.  The command is 'warp' and it must be held to work.   |
 |___________________________________________________________________________|~
ITEM_TYPE_CONTAINER
ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL|ITEM_FLAG_AUTO_ENGRAVE
ITEM_WEAR_TAKE|ITEM_WEAR_HOLD
1 CONT_CLOSEABLE -1 0
0 0 10
P 1
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 warp
OPROG_IF OIF_WEAR_LOC ! WEAR_NONE 2 7
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_OBJECT_QUEST_IF 0 1  = 0 3 21
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_WHICH_GOD = 2 4 22
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_POSITION = POS_FIGHTING 23 5
P 5
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_POSITION < POS_STANDING 24 6
P 6
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_PERCENT_HITPT < 40 25 10
P 10
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_QUEST_SET 0 1 1
P 10
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
emote disappears through a warp to Chaos's Monastery. & mpgoto 16208 & 
mpechoaround $ $ appears through a warp. &look~
P 20
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You arent holding the portable hole!~
P 21
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You cant open a gate again yet.~
P 22
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You arent a follower of Chaos! Infidel!~
P 23
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You cant warp the continuum and fight at the same time!.~
P 24
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You must stand upright to concentrate sufficiently.~
P 25
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You are too wounded to summon enough energy for this task...~
P 100
TRIG_TICK 100
OPROG_OBJECT_QUEST_IF 0 1  = 1 101 0
P 101
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_QUEST_SET 0 1 0
